Sentence|Translation
Jau sun qua dapi ina minuta|I've been here for a minute
Jau fatsch pasta dapi duas minutas|I've been making pasta for two minutes
Nus mangiain la tschagula dapi trais uras|We've been eating the onion for three hours
Nus giain ad ina posta dapi quatter dis|We've been going to a post office for four days
Ti has tschintg minutas|You have five minutes
Nus essan qua dapi sis emnas|We've been here for six weeks
Jau vi set uras per far ina mura alv|i want seven hours to make a white blackberry
Otg dis suenter che jau mangel in persic verd|Eight days after I eat a green peach
Jau vegn ad ir nov emnas suenter perquai che jau na vi betg ir ussa|I will go nine days later because I don't want to go now
Damai jau vegn ad ir diesch minutas avant che vus vulais ir|Therefore I will go ten minutes before you (pl) want to go
Ha ella in'ura u in di?|Does she have an hour or a day?
El ha in'emna però el vul tschintg emnas|He has a week but he wants five weeks